{"server":"cn","storyId":"act14side_level_act14side_01_beg","groupId":"act14side","stageId":"act14side_01","title":"不欢而聚","storyCode":"BI-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act14side/level_act14side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"34372372a1cc7454881fa3a4421bdf36c17321694a8af16f004681d75278eafd","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"博士一行应恩希欧迪斯邀请来到谢拉格，各自稍作休整后，登上前往圣山的列车。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_i01"},{"type":"narration","text":"外力。\n一点微小的外力。只要这轻轻一推......\n雪崩就会掩埋整个谢拉格，包括它所隐瞒的阴谋和发生过的一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g9_manoravenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出差的经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"老板，只是块破木牌而已，为什么卖五十镑这么贵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客人，这您就不懂了，这可不是什么普通的木牌，这是雪境之神耶拉冈德的祝福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢拉格能够免受天灾侵袭，扎根于这片土地，都是多亏了祂的庇佑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这块护符的原材料，可是取自我们谢拉格第二高的山峰少女峰峰顶的常绿乔木。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少女峰您知道吗？传说啊，那座峰是耶拉冈德流下的眼泪结冰而成的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受山上雪水浇灌的树木满含着耶拉冈德对这片土地的慈爱与祝福，用这木料制成的护符更是能保佑出入平安，祛灾辟邪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看您是第一次来谢拉格，想要给在维多利亚的家人带一些纪念品吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出差的经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，这两年，被恩希欧迪斯老爷的政策吸引来的大公司员工越来越多了，您的口音我一听就听出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像您这样初来乍到的人呢，我是特别推荐您购买这个护符作为纪念品的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知您有没有听说过山雪鬼？是我们这儿深山里头的食人怪物，面目狰狞，似人非人，神出鬼没。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但只要您戴着这受了蔓珠院赐福的护符，它们就会在耶拉冈德的威光下畏缩，不能伤你哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想，您带回去和您的家人说，这护符有谢拉格圣山的神力庇佑，也有面子不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您大老远跑到谢拉格出差，也不想回去没有什么好东西带给家人吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出差的经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出差的经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧，好吧，我买了，给我的老婆孩子各买一块！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞，就喜欢您这样豪爽的人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看啊，这木材恐怕是随便找个山头砍来的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你凭什么这么说？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，没有佩尔罗契家的许可，根本没有人可以攀爬少女峰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其次，我可从没听说过之前有人爬上过少女峰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我离开谢拉格的时候，还特意嘱咐过魏斯哥，要是有人爬上去了给我报个信呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，这个尾巴......您难道是恩希亚小姐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出差的经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亚......你、您是恩希欧迪斯先生的妹妹？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出差的经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，老板，你难道真的在骗我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，哈哈哈，听说恩希亚小姐自幼热爱登山，对于雪山的了解果然比我们普通人要强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我店里的这些货其实也是从山上的猎人那里进的，肯定是那些猎人骗了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之后就去找他们算账！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于这个护符......恩希亚小姐，您看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个护符有蔓珠院的赐福倒不假，没有谢拉格人胆敢伪造蔓珠院的印信冒犯耶拉冈德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想凭它抵挡传闻中的山雪鬼就算了吧。不过当作纪念品带回去的话，我觉得应该还是很合适的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，卖便宜点就好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......既然如此，我这就把定价改成十镑！那，这位先生，您还买吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出差的经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"既然那位恩希欧迪斯先生的妹妹都这么说了，我肯定是相信的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出差的经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"老板你做生意也不容易，我买五个吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩希亚小姐呢，您要买一些什么吗？只要是您喜欢的，您随便拿就是，毕竟我这生意也是受了希瓦艾什家的照顾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用不用，我正常付钱就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对吧，博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"当然。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"幸好特意换了不少维多利亚和卡西米尔货币。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，反正换了再多，也只能在我们家的领地用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我们家的领地中，最繁荣的就是这座贸易港了，所以博士你就算把钱全都花在这里也没关系的。"}]},{"label":"既然是自家的领地，不能随便拿吗？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，博士，别人也是要做生意的呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你要是真的想，我们可以去拜托老哥试试看。反正老哥会处理好的！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"二小姐，我们差不多该去车站等车了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，现在时间紧，博士，我们出发吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大雪将至，当心些，外乡人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你是？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不想受冻的话，现在离开还不算晚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你在发什么呆？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有人向我搭话。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？可是你身边没有人啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"现在并不是能够惬意地在室外享受咖啡的季节。\n回首望去，你只看见了鲜艳的遮阳棚顶与喀兰贸易的广告标语。\n空无一人的露台静默着，一如远处的皑皑山峦。\n或许是桌上的杂志被风翻动书页的哗哗声让你产生了有人坐在桌边向你搭话的错觉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g9_manoravenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":"avgnew_173_slchan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，别发呆了，走了走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们还会再见面的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰大哥，你来了，老爷正在等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这段时间辛苦你了，魏斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来要去的，不过老爷想要邀请博士一同前往圣山出席三族议会，让我留下来代替你接待他们，毕竟我也算罗德岛的一员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在外保护二小姐这么久，老爷觉得你也该放个假了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，看样子，你应该是被二小姐赶出来的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，是。二小姐在和博士一起逛街。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二小姐也是想给我放个假，就让我不用管她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是兄妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，这次回来的感觉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"领地建设很快，整体变化很大，已经快要认不出来了。不愧是老爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那承蒙老爷和二小姐的厚意，我先回一趟老家，看看爹和娘，然后去老爷那里待命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也有一阵子没回来了吧，上次见面的时候，你不是要跟老爷去哥伦比亚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没什么要紧事情，能回来在街上转转就很满足了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那个同族的老朋友呢？我记得是叫莫希吧，有空一起吃顿饭吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......到时候再看情况吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g5_guestroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"听得到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"听得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"太好了，看来基站的信号没有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我找到了几个适合安装通讯基站的隐蔽地点。不过无论如何，在图里卡姆安装基站的话，是不可能覆盖到整个谢拉格的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这里是谢拉格南侧门户，事实上也是谢拉格唯一和外界联通的关口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"在这里建立通讯网的意义非常重大，但想要让通讯覆盖整个谢拉格，就最好在中央的湖区周边再部署几个简易基站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是问你这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......？队长你让我出去逛逛不是让我去踩点的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我是问，你很久没回谢拉格了，感觉如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"老实说，我觉得很不可思议。我通过希瓦艾什家的人才培养计划离开谢拉格时，也是从这里出发的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那时，不要说国境线列车站了，连这图里卡姆，也还是一座很普通的小镇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"没想到它能有这么大的变化。现在就算和外面的城市比，也可以说毫不逊色了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"要在雪山上做这样的建设，有多大难度我想都不敢想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"挺好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"队长，你们现在在哪，我来找你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我们正要坐列车去喀兰圣山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"你先不用过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"你说过，你家在山上的工业区吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"先回家看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么比家人更重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"你既然都已经回到雪山了，正好是回家看看的机会，这也是博士的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"博士也这么说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......我知道了，那就恭敬不如从命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极光","speakerId":"avg_422_aurora_1","isRemote":true,"text":"至于博士那边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"有我跟着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"开往喀兰圣山脚下的列车即将发车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请还没上车的旅客抓紧上车。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"我要出发了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":"avg_npc_252","isRemote":false,"text":"好好休息，极光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伴着汽笛声以及轻微的通讯声，开往圣山的列车缓缓启动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我来给你介绍一下这些山峰的名字吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你看，那座坡有些平缓的山峰叫作少女峰，是第三代圣女命名的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希亚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那边那座很陡峭的山峰，叫作马特洪峰，其实也是角峰名字的来源。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n恩希亚滔滔不绝地讲述着沿途的风景以及与谢拉格有关的一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_i02"},{"type":"narration","text":"讯使带着一如既往的笑容，在一旁安静地聆听，但他时不时投向远方的眼神，带着一丝说不清的情绪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_i02"},{"type":"narration","text":"Sharp靠在座椅上浏览着网页，他会发现，谢拉格的网络内容充实得出乎他意料。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_i02"},{"type":"narration","text":"你一边听着恩希亚的话，一边将视线投向窗外。\n窗外，倒映着蓝天的湖泊上残留着薄冰，一些本地人聚在浅滩边，有的打水有的洗衣，有说有笑。\n白雪皑皑的群山巍然屹立，想要抬头去看它的尖端，就会被阳光阻拦。\n平缓的山腰上，年轻的牧人驱赶着牧兽群向家里走去，见到列车上的人，他没有惊讶，反而举起鞭子向这边打招呼。\n不远处，是他居住的村庄，炊烟袅袅，安静祥和。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_i02"},{"type":"narration","text":"一切都令人心旷神怡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"或许，这会是一次不错的旅行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_198_blackd","aliases":["魏斯"]}]}
